{"id":"C1-L024","title":"distinguish something from something — form","cefr":"C1","level":"C1","unit":"C1-U02","focus":"distinguish something from something — forma","targets":{"grammar":"distinguish something from something — forma","pron":"Pausas e ritmo","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["strategy consultancy","market trend","passing fad","noise and signal","short-term spike","structural change","risk and opportunity","free consultation","competitive analysis","evidence-based advice","executive briefing","trend report","strategic review","industry outlook","consulting fee","client engagement","decision framework","scenario planning","data signal","market scan","slogan-driven","differentiator"],"field":"Negócios","genre":"Anúncio, folheto, aviso","skill":"Escuta","words_min":22},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 24 · distinguish something from something — form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** distinguish something from something — forma.","**Pronúncia:** Pausas e ritmo.","**22 palavras novas** (negócios).","**Texto do dia:** anúncio, folheto, aviso."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (C1):** eu consigo usar distinguish A from B, tell A from B, differentiate between e draw a distinction em um anúncio de consultoria."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["strategy consultancy","consultoria estratégica"],["market trend","tendência de mercado"],["passing fad","moda passageira"],["noise and signal","ruído e sinal"],["short-term spike","pico de curto prazo"],["structural change","mudança estrutural"],["risk and opportunity","risco e oportunidade"],["free consultation","consulta gratuita"],["competitive analysis","análise competitiva"],["evidence-based advice","aconselhamento baseado em evidências"],["executive briefing","briefing executivo"],["trend report","relatório de tendências"],["strategic review","revisão estratégica"],["industry outlook","perspectiva do setor"],["consulting fee","honorário de consultoria"],["client engagement","contrato com cliente"],["decision framework","estrutura de decisão"],["scenario planning","planejamento de cenários"],["data signal","sinal de dados"],["market scan","varredura de mercado"],["slogan-driven","guiado por slogans"],["differentiator","diferencial"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An advertisement","blocks":[{"type":"ad","title":"Strategy Partners: See What Others Miss","lines":["Can you **distinguish** a trend **from** a fad? We help executives **tell** noise **from** signal. Our analysts **differentiate between** short-term spikes and structural change, and **draw a clear distinction** between risk and opportunity.","What **distinguishes** us **from** our competitors is evidence, not slogans. Book a free consultation today."],"gloss":[["trend","tendência"],["fad","moda passageira"],["spike","pico"],["slogan","slogan"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The firm helps executives tell a trend from a fad.","ans":"T","why":"distinguish a trend from a fad."},{"q":"The firm uses slogans.","ans":"F","why":"evidence, not slogans."},{"q":"The first consultation is paid.","ans":"F","why":"free consultation."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“fad” = ?","opts":["moda passageira","fada","fado"],"ans":0,"why":"a fad."},{"q":"“spike” = ?","opts":["pico","espinho só","espaço"],"ans":0,"why":"short-term spikes."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"distinguish A from B e sinônimos","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["distinguish A from B","**Distinguish a trend from a fad.**"],["tell A from B","**I can’t tell one twin from the other.**"],["differentiate between A and B","**Differentiate between risk and opportunity.**"],["draw a distinction between A and B","**Draw a clear distinction between them.**"]],"cap":"distinguish A from B e sinônimos"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**distinguish** pede **from**; **differentiate** pede **between … and**. O substantivo é **distinction**."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Não confunda **distinguish** (diferenciar) com **extinguish** (extinguir)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Can you distinguish a trend ___ a fad? (from)","a":"from","why":"distinguish from."},{"s":"Differentiate ___ risk and opportunity. (between)","a":"between","why":"differentiate between."},{"s":"Draw a clear ___ between them. (distinction)","a":"distinction","why":"substantivo."},{"s":"What ___ us from competitors is evidence. (distinguishes)","a":"distinguishes","why":"verbo."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["strategy consultancy","consultoria estratégica"],["market trend","tendência de mercado"],["passing fad","moda passageira"],["noise and signal","ruído e sinal"],["short-term spike","pico de curto prazo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["not","slogans","Evidence"],"ans":"Evidence not slogans","pt":"Evidências, não slogans."},{"words":["you","from","competitors","What","distinguishes"],"ans":"What distinguishes you from competitors","pt":"O que distingue vocês dos concorrentes?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"strategy consultancy","pos":"word","pt":"consultoria estratégica","ex":"Strategy consultancy.","expt":"Consultoria estratégica."},{"w":"market trend","pos":"word","pt":"tendência de mercado","ex":"Market trend.","expt":"Tendência de mercado."},{"w":"passing fad","pos":"word","pt":